	"building-boardinghouse": "Boarding House",
	"hut-placed-boardinghouse": "{0} placed. Build around it and fill it with beds. Settlers sleep here until a Residence has room.",
	"guide-boardinghouse": "<strong>Boarding House</strong><br>Cheap room for many settlers. Every bed inside the building is a place to sleep. It has two levels at most.<br><br><strong>Nobody likes it</strong><br>A boarder is a little unhappy, where a Residence bed makes a settler happier. Level 2 is a little less bad.<br><br><strong>Moving out</strong><br>Settlers take a Residence bed first. Boarders move into a Residence by themselves when one has room for their whole household. Families go first.<br><br><strong>No children</strong><br>Couples do not have children while they board.",
