	"questgroup-colony": "The Colony",
	"quest-kingdom-q1": "A New Beginning",
	"quest-kingdom-q1-desc": "Place the Supply Camp, then the Town Hall, to found your colony. Or join a colony that is already there.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the Supply Camp, take its kit, then place the Town Hall.",
	"quest-kingdom-h0": "Foundations",
	"quest-kingdom-h0-desc": "Found a colony. This opens the first branch.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the Supply Camp, take its kit, then place the Town Hall.",
	"quest-kingdom-q2": "The Heart of the Colony",
	"quest-kingdom-q2-desc": "Place the Town Hall and found your colony.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q3": "First Brick",
	"quest-kingdom-q3-desc": "Build a Builder's Hut and give a settler the builder's job.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut. Build the hut for the job. A free settler takes the job, or you can pick one in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q17": "Solid Foundations",
	"quest-kingdom-q17-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 2.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-tax1": "First Taxes",
	"quest-kingdom-tax1-desc": "A colony that pays its way needs a treasury. Have your bailiff collect taxes for the first time.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> In the Town Hall, give one settler the Bailiff job on the Citizens tab, then set Tax above 0% on the Bailiff tab. On the next payday the bailiff takes that share of every settler's purse for the treasury.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Settlers need coins in their purse to be taxed, and every 5% of tax costs a little happiness.",
	"objective-text-firsttaxes": "Have the bailiff collect taxes",
	"quest-kingdom-q18": "Self-Sufficient",
	"quest-kingdom-q18-desc": "Keep 200 pieces of food in the colony's storage, enough to feed everyone for days.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Food in the Warehouse and in hut storage all counts.",
	"quest-kingdom-q4": "Roof Over Their Heads",
	"quest-kingdom-q4-desc": "Build a Tavern.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q5": "Welcome Home",
	"quest-kingdom-q5-desc": "Wait for a visitor to arrive at the Tavern, then recruit them.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Visitors come to the Tavern by themselves. Keep it built and the colony fed.",
	"quest-kingdom-q6": "Beds for Four",
	"quest-kingdom-q6-desc": "Build a Residence so four settlers have beds.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q7": "Feed the People",
	"quest-kingdom-q7-desc": "Build a Farmer's Hut and mark out at least one field.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q8": "Fish for Dinner",
	"quest-kingdom-q8-desc": "Build a Fisher's Hut. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q13": "Hot Meal",
	"quest-kingdom-q13-desc": "Build a Cook's Hut and give a settler the cook's job.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut. Build the hut for the job. A free settler takes the job, or you can pick one in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q9": "Wood for the Fires",
	"quest-kingdom-q9-desc": "Build a Forester's Hut.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q10": "Stone and Ore",
	"quest-kingdom-q10-desc": "Build a mine for stone and ore.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q11": "Guarding the Gate",
	"quest-kingdom-q11-desc": "Build a Guard Tower.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q12": "The First Courier",
	"quest-kingdom-q12-desc": "Build a Courier's Station and a Warehouse.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q15": "Basic Research",
	"quest-kingdom-q15-desc": "Build an Archive and give a settler the researcher's job.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut. Build the hut for the job. A free settler takes the job, or you can pick one in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q16": "First Knowledge",
	"quest-kingdom-q16-desc": "Finish any piece of research.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Pick research at the Archive and keep Researchers working there.",
	"quest-kingdom-q14": "Population Milestone I",
	"quest-kingdom-q14-desc": "Reach 8 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-h1": "Growing the Settlement",
	"quest-kingdom-h1-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 2. This opens the second branch.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q38": "Town Hall Level 3",
	"quest-kingdom-q38-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q42": "Mid-Game Checkpoint",
	"quest-kingdom-q42-desc": "Have 5 different production huts at level 2 or above.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Upgrade your work huts from their Upgrade tab. Each kind of hut counts once.",
	"quest-kingdom-q19": "More Beds",
	"quest-kingdom-q19-desc": "Have 3 Residences.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Only finished buildings count. Keep your builders supplied.",
	"quest-kingdom-q20": "Population Milestone II",
	"quest-kingdom-q20-desc": "Reach 15 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q34": "Population Milestone III",
	"quest-kingdom-q34-desc": "Reach 25 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q39": "Happiness Check",
	"quest-kingdom-q39-desc": "Keep your settlers happy: an average happiness of 70 or more.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Happiness comes from good food, a home, safety, health and rest. The Town Hall shows what is pulling it down.",
	"quest-kingdom-q21": "Better Builders",
	"quest-kingdom-q21-desc": "Upgrade the Builder's Hut to level 2.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q22": "Expanded Farm",
	"quest-kingdom-q22-desc": "Upgrade the Farmer's Hut to level 2 and add 2 more fields.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q23": "Deeper Mines",
	"quest-kingdom-q23-desc": "Upgrade the mine to level 2.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q31": "Hospital Care",
	"quest-kingdom-q31-desc": "Set up a Healer's Station to care for the sick and hurt.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q32": "Library of Knowledge",
	"quest-kingdom-q32-desc": "Build a Library. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q33": "School Days",
	"quest-kingdom-q33-desc": "Build a School. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q24": "Saw the Future",
	"quest-kingdom-q24-desc": "Build a Sawmill.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q25": "Stone Shapers",
	"quest-kingdom-q25-desc": "Build a Stonemason's Hut. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q26": "Smelting Begins",
	"quest-kingdom-q26-desc": "Build a Smelter's Hut.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q27": "Compost Cycle",
	"quest-kingdom-q27-desc": "Build a Composter's Hut. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q29": "First Barracks",
	"quest-kingdom-q29-desc": "Build a Barracks.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q30": "Guard Training",
	"quest-kingdom-q30-desc": "Build a place for guards to train. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q37": "First Raid Survival",
	"quest-kingdom-q37-desc": "Beat off a raid: kill the raiders before they get away.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Raids start once the colony has 8 grown settlers. Have guards ready, or send a raid yourself from the Town Hall Settings tab.",
	"quest-kingdom-q28": "Bakery Bread",
	"quest-kingdom-q28-desc": "Build a Bakery. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q40": "Animal Husbandry Start",
	"quest-kingdom-q40-desc": "Build any two animal huts.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Upgrade your work huts from their Upgrade tab. Each kind of hut counts once.",
	"quest-kingdom-q41": "Apiary Honey",
	"quest-kingdom-q41-desc": "Build an Apiary for honey.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q35": "Warehouse Expansion",
	"quest-kingdom-q35-desc": "Upgrade the Warehouse to level 2.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q36": "Courier Network",
	"quest-kingdom-q36-desc": "Have 3 settlers working as couriers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Build the hut for the job. A free settler takes the job, or you can pick one in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-h2": "Industrial Heart",
	"quest-kingdom-h2-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 3. This opens the third branch.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q68": "Industrial Checkpoint",
	"quest-kingdom-q68-desc": "Have 3 production huts at level 3 or above.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Upgrade your work huts from their Upgrade tab. Each kind of hut counts once.",
	"quest-kingdom-q59": "Population Milestone IV",
	"quest-kingdom-q59-desc": "Reach 40 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q60": "Housing Quality",
	"quest-kingdom-q60-desc": "Have Residences at an average level of 2.5 or more.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Upgrade every one of these buildings. The quest looks at the average of them all.",
	"quest-kingdom-q65": "Restaurant Level 3",
	"quest-kingdom-q65-desc": "Upgrade the Cook's Hut to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q66": "School + Library Level 2",
	"quest-kingdom-q66-desc": "Have a School and a Library at level 2. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q43": "Blacksmith's Forge",
	"quest-kingdom-q43-desc": "Build a Blacksmith's Hut.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q44": "Glassworks",
