	"quest-kingdom-q54": "University Level 3",
	"quest-kingdom-q54-desc": "Upgrade the Archive to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q55": "Research Depth",
	"quest-kingdom-q55-desc": "Finish 8 pieces of research.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Pick research at the Archive and keep Researchers working there.",
	"quest-kingdom-q56": "Civilian Tree Progress",
	"quest-kingdom-q56-desc": "Finish 4 pieces of Civilian research. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q57": "Technology Tree Progress",
	"quest-kingdom-q57-desc": "Finish 4 pieces of Technology research. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q46": "Dye & Flowers",
	"quest-kingdom-q46-desc": "Build a Florist and a Dyer's Hut. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q47": "Fletcher's Arrows",
	"quest-kingdom-q47-desc": "Build a Fletcher's Hut. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q52": "Alchemist's Lab",
	"quest-kingdom-q52-desc": "Build an Alchemist's Laboratory. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q53": "Enchanter's Tomes",
	"quest-kingdom-q53-desc": "Build an Enchanter's Tower. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q58": "Combat Tree Progress",
	"quest-kingdom-q58-desc": "Finish 3 pieces of Combat research. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q61": "Barracks 2 + 4 Guard Towers",
	"quest-kingdom-q61-desc": "Upgrade the Barracks to level 2 and have 4 Guard Towers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut. Only finished buildings count. Keep your builders supplied.",
	"quest-kingdom-q62": "Knight & Ranger Training",
	"quest-kingdom-q62-desc": "Have both melee and ranged guards. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q63": "Raid Veteran",
	"quest-kingdom-q63-desc": "Survive 3 raids. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q49": "Advanced Farming",
	"quest-kingdom-q49-desc": "Upgrade the Farmer's Hut to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q50": "Plantation Empire",
	"quest-kingdom-q50-desc": "Build a Plantation for special crops. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q51": "Full Animal Suite",
	"quest-kingdom-q51-desc": "Have all five kinds of herder hut.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q64": "Warehouse Level 3",
	"quest-kingdom-q64-desc": "Upgrade the Warehouse to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q67": "Builder's Hut Level 3",
	"quest-kingdom-q67-desc": "Upgrade the Builder's Hut to level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-h3": "Kingdom Rising",
	"quest-kingdom-h3-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 4. This opens the fourth branch.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q69": "Town Hall Level 4",
	"quest-kingdom-q69-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 4.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q90": "City Checkpoint",
	"quest-kingdom-q90-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 5.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q71": "Population Milestone V",
	"quest-kingdom-q71-desc": "Reach 60 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q72": "Happiness Paradise",
	"quest-kingdom-q72-desc": "Reach an average happiness of 85 or more.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Happiness comes from good food, a home, safety, health and rest. The Town Hall shows what is pulling it down.",
	"quest-kingdom-q77": "High-Level Housing",
	"quest-kingdom-q77-desc": "Have 5 Residences at level 4 or above.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Only finished buildings count. Keep your builders supplied.",
	"quest-kingdom-q86": "Population Milestone VI",
	"quest-kingdom-q86-desc": "Reach 80 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q80": "Production Mastery",
	"quest-kingdom-q80-desc": "Have 5 different production huts at level 4 or above.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Upgrade your work huts from their Upgrade tab. Each kind of hut counts once.",
	"quest-kingdom-q81": "Logistics Empire",
	"quest-kingdom-q81-desc": "Upgrade the Warehouse to level 4.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q84": "Animal Paradise",
	"quest-kingdom-q84-desc": "Have every herder hut at level 3 or above.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q85": "Builder's Guild",
	"quest-kingdom-q85-desc": "Upgrade the Builder's Hut to level 4 and have more than one builder.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut. Build the hut for the job. A free settler takes the job, or you can pick one in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q70": "University Level 4-5",
	"quest-kingdom-q70-desc": "Upgrade the Archive to level 4.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q73": "Full Research Sweep",
	"quest-kingdom-q73-desc": "Finish one full column in each research tree. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q74": "Column 6 Choice",
	"quest-kingdom-q74-desc": "Finish a column 6 research in any tree. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q88": "Research Completionist",
	"quest-kingdom-q88-desc": "Finish 20 pieces of research.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Pick research at the Archive and keep Researchers working there.",
	"quest-kingdom-q75": "Mystical Site",
	"quest-kingdom-q75-desc": "Build a Mystical Site. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q76": "Graveyard Remembrance",
	"quest-kingdom-q76-desc": "Build a Graveyard and give a settler the Undertaker job, so the dead are laid to rest.",
	"quest-kingdom-q83": "Luxury Living",
	"quest-kingdom-q83-desc": "Build a fine Cook's Hut, a Bakery and a park. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q89": "Trade & Visitors",
	"quest-kingdom-q89-desc": "Welcome 10 visitors to the colony over time.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Visitors come to the Tavern by themselves. Keep it built and the colony fed.",
	"quest-kingdom-q78": "Elite Guards",
	"quest-kingdom-q78-desc": "Upgrade the Barracks to level 4 and hand out good armour and weapons.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q79": "Raid Master",
	"quest-kingdom-q79-desc": "Survive a large raid with few settlers lost. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q87": "Defense Network",
	"quest-kingdom-q87-desc": "Defend the colony with 6 Guard Towers and a Barracks at level 3.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Only finished buildings count. Keep your builders supplied. Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q82": "Education Hub",
	"quest-kingdom-q82-desc": "Have a School, a Library and an Archive at a high level. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-h4": "Endgame & Legacy",
	"quest-kingdom-h4-desc": "Upgrade the Town Hall to level 5. This opens the last branch.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the hut with the Builder's Wand and have a builder finish it. To raise its level, use the Upgrade tab in the hut.",
	"quest-kingdom-q100": "Founder's Legacy",
	"quest-kingdom-q100-desc": "Look back on how far the colony has come.",
	"quest-kingdom-q91": "Perfect Happiness",
	"quest-kingdom-q91-desc": "Reach an average happiness of 90 or more.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Happiness comes from good food, a home, safety, health and rest. The Town Hall shows what is pulling it down.",
	"quest-kingdom-q92": "Population Cap Push",
	"quest-kingdom-q92-desc": "Reach 100 settlers.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> New settlers come when there are free beds, enough food and a happy colony. Build more Residences to make room.",
	"quest-kingdom-q98": "Legacy Citizens",
	"quest-kingdom-q98-desc": "Have 3 settlers with a skill at its highest level.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Settlers gain skill by doing their job. Keep them in the same job and well fed.",
	"quest-kingdom-q93": "Full Style Mastery",
	"quest-kingdom-q93-desc": "Bring 10 buildings to level 5.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Only finished buildings count. Keep your builders supplied.",
	"quest-kingdom-q97": "Monument Builder",
	"quest-kingdom-q97-desc": "Build a monument, park or fountain of your own design: place 200 blocks.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Place the blocks yourself, anywhere. This counts every block you set down.",
	"quest-kingdom-q94": "Raid Legend",
	"quest-kingdom-q94-desc": "Survive every kind of raid. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q96": "Self-Sustaining Fortress",
	"quest-kingdom-q96-desc": "Let the colony run for 30 days and keep its happiness at 80 or more.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> The colony only needs to last. Days pass as you play. Happiness comes from good food, a home, safety, health and rest. The Town Hall shows what is pulling it down.",
	"quest-kingdom-q95": "Research Perfection",
	"quest-kingdom-q95-desc": "Finish every research. The colony has no such building yet. This comes in a later update.",
	"quest-kingdom-q99": "The Grand Tour",
	"quest-kingdom-q99-desc": "Stand beside 15 different kinds of hut in your colony.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Walk through your colony and stand next to each kind of hut.",
	"chapter-kingdom": "Foundations of a Kingdom",
	"chapter-research": "Research",
	"quest-research-burialrites": "Burial Rites",
	"quest-research-burialrites-desc": "Finish the Burial Rites research. The Healer works 15% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Population branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-archery": "Archery",
	"quest-research-archery-desc": "Finish the Archery research. Guards hit 10% harder.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Defence branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-roadbuilding": "Road Building",
	"quest-research-roadbuilding-desc": "Finish the Road Building research. All settlers walk 10% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Settlement branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-mastermasons": "Master Masons",
	"quest-research-mastermasons-desc": "Finish the Master Masons research. Builders work 20% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Settlement branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-stonecutting": "Stonecutting",
	"quest-research-stonecutting-desc": "Finish the Stonecutting research. Quarriers and miners dig 20% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Settlement branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-cropscience": "Crop Science",
	"quest-research-cropscience-desc": "Finish the Crop Science research. Farmers harvest 10% more, on top of Crop Rotation.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Production branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-guildworkshops": "Guild Workshops",
	"quest-research-guildworkshops-desc": "Finish the Guild Workshops research. Crafting jobs work 15% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Production branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-efficientsmelting": "Efficient Smelting",
	"quest-research-efficientsmelting-desc": "Finish the Efficient Smelting research. Smelters and smiths use 20% less fuel.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Production branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-medicine": "Medicine",
	"quest-research-medicine-desc": "Finish the Medicine research. Settlers heal 50% faster in bed.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Population branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-schooling": "Schooling",
	"quest-research-schooling-desc": "Finish the Schooling research. Settlers learn skills 20% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Population branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-townlife": "Town Life",
	"quest-research-townlife-desc": "Finish the Town Life research. 2 more settlers per Town Hall level.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Population branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-drillyards": "Drill Yards",
	"quest-research-drillyards-desc": "Finish the Drill Yards research. Guards hit 15% harder.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Defence branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-stonewalls": "Stone Walls",
	"quest-research-stonewalls-desc": "Finish the Stone Walls research. Guards get 4 more health.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Defence branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-surveying": "Surveying",
	"quest-research-surveying-desc": "Finish the Surveying research. Explorers go 25% further.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Exploration branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-expeditions": "Expeditions",
	"quest-research-expeditions-desc": "Finish the Expeditions research. Field notes give 50% more points. Gives 1 Knowledge Token.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Exploration branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 3 and an Archive at tier 2.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-grandlibrary": "Grand Library",
	"quest-research-grandlibrary-desc": "Finish the Grand Library research. Research is 25% faster, and each Archive runs 1 more research at once.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Population branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 5 and an Archive at tier 3 and 2 Knowledge Tokens.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-charterrealm": "Charter of the Realm",
	"quest-research-charterrealm-desc": "Finish the Charter of the Realm research. The land claim grows 32 more blocks each way, and 2 more settlers per Town Hall level.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Settlement branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 5 and an Archive at tier 3 and 2 Knowledge Tokens.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-mechanics": "Mechanics",
	"quest-research-mechanics-desc": "Finish the Mechanics research. Crafting jobs work 15% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Production branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 5 and an Archive at tier 3 and 2 Knowledge Tokens.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-standingarmy": "Standing Army",
	"quest-research-standingarmy-desc": "Finish the Standing Army research. Guards get 4 more health and hit 15% harder.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Defence branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 5 and an Archive at tier 3 and 2 Knowledge Tokens.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"quest-research-atlasworld": "Atlas of the World",
	"quest-research-atlasworld-desc": "Finish the Atlas of the World research. Explorers go 50% further and walk 15% faster.<br><br><strong>How:</strong> Start it on the Archive's Research tab, Exploration branch. Couriers bring the items, then Researchers study. It needs Town Hall level 5 and an Archive at tier 3 and 2 Knowledge Tokens.<br><br><strong>Tip:</strong> Hand in books, relics and field notes at the Archive to speed it up.",
	"townhall-quests-later": "later",
