	"tab-church": "Church",
	"hut-placed-church": "{0} placed. Right-click it to order level 1 and give a settler the Priest job. Services are held every 7 days.",
	"hint-church": "The priest holds a service every 7 days, buries the dead, and writes the colony's history in books. Settlers give part of their wages to the church, and it spends that on the poor, the hungry and the sick.",
	"hint-healer-station": "The healer works at this station inside the Church. They make bandages (Crafting recipes tab) and treat settlers in bed. Bandages are kept in the Church's storage.",
	"guide-church": "<strong>Church</strong><br>Priests work here. At level 3 one of them can be the Bishop.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the Church, choose who works here, and order upgrades. In Manage workers, click a priest's role to make them the Bishop.<br><strong>Church</strong>: Faith, the next service, the tithe, and what the church spent.<br><br><strong>Services</strong>: every 7 days at 9 in the morning. Settlers with some Faith come and stand by the Church block. Going makes them happy, raises their Faith, and helps them learn faster for a day. Now and then someone gets a level in a skill. Devout settlers are unhappy if they miss one.<br><strong>Tithe</strong>: 0, 5 or 10% of each wage goes to the church. Settlers with less Faith give less. Settlers with little Faith grumble at 10%.<br><strong>Charity</strong>: if the colony runs out of food, the church buys bread for the hungry. It buys bandages for the Healer's Station, looks after orphans, and gives beds inside the Church to settlers with no home.<br><strong>Funerals</strong>: the priest buries the dead. Family and friends feel better after.<br><strong>Records</strong>: put blank books and an ink and quill in the Church's storage. The priest writes what happened in the colony into a book.<br><strong>Paintings</strong>: put church paintings in the Church or the warehouse. The priest hangs them on the Church walls.<br><br><strong>Work stations</strong>: the Healer's Station goes inside the Church's build zone.",
