	"hint-apiary": "The beekeeper looks after the skeps up to {0} blocks from the hut. It harvests full ones and sets the empty skep back. It needs a knife.",
	"guide-apiary": "<strong>Apiary</strong><br>The beekeeper looks after the beehives near the hut.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Work area</strong>: how far out the hives can be, and Keep the last colony.<br><br>Put a skep with bees near the hut, with flowers around it. Keep a knife and a few empty skeps in the hut. Honeycomb goes to the hut, and couriers take it to the warehouse.<br><br><strong>Level 1</strong>: looks after 2 hives and harvests full skeps.<br><strong>Level 2</strong>: 4 hives. Sets out empty skeps so swarms move in. Works ceramic hives (From Golden Combs).<br><strong>Level 3</strong>: 6 hives. Walks out to wild hives the gatherer marked, sets a skep by them, and brings the bees home.<br><strong>Level 4 and 5</strong>: 8 and 10 hives.",
