	"shroudedbody-info": "An undertaker will bury them. Put it in a Graveyard's storage.",
	"hut-placed-graveyard": "{0} placed. Give a settler the Undertaker job, and put grave plots on the ground near the hut.",
	"hint-graveyard": "The undertaker collects the dead up to {0} blocks from the Graveyard, digs a grave at a grave plot and buries them. Their belongings go into the hut storage. It needs a shovel.",
	"guide-graveyard": "<strong>Graveyard</strong><br>The undertaker brings the dead home and buries them.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, order upgrades, and see who lies here.<br><strong>Work area</strong>: how far out the undertaker goes to collect the dead.<br><br>Craft grave plots (2 sticks and a plank) and put them on the ground near the hut, up to 16 blocks away. Each plot is one grave. Keep a shovel in the hut. The belongings of the dead go into the hut storage, and couriers take them to the warehouse. After the burial the undertaker holds a small funeral. A priest still holds the full funeral at the grave.<br><br><strong>Level 1</strong>: 1 undertaker, 8 graves, wooden grave markers.<br><strong>Level 2</strong>: 16 graves, stone headstones.<br><strong>Level 3</strong>: 2 undertakers, 24 graves.<br><strong>Level 4</strong>: 36 graves. The dead are buried next to their family.<br><strong>Level 5</strong>: 3 undertakers, 50 graves.",
